<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 178)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Shot names are never cropped in the PDF report</b> — they wrap onto as many lines as they need.</li>
<li>Tidier movie-export dialog.</li>
<li>Carries the microphone fix from build 175: voice notes can now ask for permission properly.</li>
</ul>
